  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] acts as a member of Tokiwano sculpture club. Her best work is Sweat No.2VOPN. This piece bears an illustration of a missile. If you squint your eyes, the unbalanced composition of the image reveals the outline of a gourd. -->
